            %p
          The point here is the given interpretation of this
          = succeed "," do
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lifting+problem"} lifting problem
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              Under the given assumptions, the essentially unique existence of the lift is an instance of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28n-connected%2C+n-truncated%29+factorization+system"} (n-connected, n-truncated) factorization system
              for
              = succeed "." do
